# HealthTrack 

A simple health tracker with a symptom checker and a stroke risk screener.
Inspired by SIH1325, AI Assisted Tele-medicine Kiosk for Rural India.

- Live app: https://eunicemercy123.github.io/HealthTrack/
- Notebook: HealthTrack.ipynb (open in Google Colab)
- Data: Kaggle "Disease Symptom Prediction" and "Stroke Prediction Dataset"

This is a screening and tracking tool, not a medical diagnosis.
